{"schema_version":"1.0.0","metadata":{"trial_id":"202610080659-redstone-workshop","prompting_method_id":"concept-build-free.v0","model_id":"claude-opus-5-5","seed":11,"server_state_id":"concept-free.v1"},"style":{"name":"Redstone Engineer's Workshop — brick industrial with exposed dark-oak frame","rationale":"Brick hall (x0-10, z0-13) on a 1-high stone-brick plinth course, framed by full-height dark-oak log posts projecting to z=-1 at x=0/7/10 that rise from the pavement to a projecting plank cornice with upside-down stair brackets on all four sides, and a set-back brick parapet capped in stone-brick slabs above it. A continuous dark-oak beam line at y=6 splits the front into a base and an upper zone and wraps the west side. Bay 1 is the open machine window (x1-6, y2-5): a stone sill with a dark-oak slab counter to lean on, a 2-deep plank hood with a stepped stair-and-slab top, end brackets and hanging lanterns. Behind it the machine is set back to z=2-4 (andesite bed, redstone dust, droppers fed by hoppers, and a lit redstone-lamp row), so the red sits inside a grey-and-timber frame. Bay 2 is a tall narrow window recessed 1 behind brick reveals, with the beam passing in front as a transom. The spruce sign board stands 1 proud, centred over the opening at x2-5 rather than x3-6, carries lettered dark-oak wall signs and is flanked by iron-trapdoor louvres. Vents moved to x1/x6 and the bay-2 window became full height, because the doc's x1-2 and x8-9 vents clashed with the sign and the window. The lower office wing has a lean-to dark-oak stair roof rising west from an overhanging eave to meet the hall under its cornice; the stairs face west, not north, so the slope actually climbs to the hall wall. Brick gable infill, a recessed door and window sharing a slab-top canopy, a fern on the sill, barrel crates, a corner post and shuttered side windows. Andesite-wall stacks with polished caps stand on the roof, and a corbelled brick chimney narrows to a 2x1 flue with lit campfires. An andesite-wall duct runs down the hall's east wall into the office. The street has a cobble pavement with a stone-brick curb. The back is plain brick with a service door."},"palette":{"manifest":["minecraft:stone_bricks","minecraft:cobblestone","minecraft:bricks","minecraft:dark_oak_planks","minecraft:dark_oak_slab","minecraft:glass_pane","minecraft:polished_andesite","minecraft:redstone_wire","minecraft:dropper","minecraft:hopper","minecraft:redstone_lamp","minecraft:chest","minecraft:dark_oak_fence","minecraft:dark_oak_trapdoor","minecraft:dark_oak_stairs","minecraft:dark_oak_door","minecraft:dark_oak_log","minecraft:potted_fern","minecraft:barrel","minecraft:stone_brick_slab","minecraft:andesite_wall","minecraft:campfire","minecraft:lantern","minecraft:spruce_planks","minecraft:dark_oak_wall_sign","minecraft:dark_oak_hanging_sign","minecraft:iron_trapdoor"]},"placements":[{"op":"fill","from":[-1,0,-2],"to":[16,0,-2],"block":"minecraft:stone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[-1,0,-1],"to":[16,0,-1],"block":"minecraft:cobblestone"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,0,0],"to":[10,0,13],"block":"minecraft:stone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[11,0,0],"to":[15,0,9],"block":"minecraft:stone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,1,0],"to":[0,10,13],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[10,1,0],"to":[10,10,13],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[1,1,13],"to":[9,10,13],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"line","from":[7,2,0],"to":[7,10,0],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[1,7,0],"to":[6,10,0],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"line","from":[8,10,0],"to":[9,10,0],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"line","from":[7,2,1],"to":[7,9,1],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[15,1,0],"to":[15,5,9],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[11,1,9],"to":[14,5,9],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[11,4,0],"to":[15,5,0],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[14,1,0],"to":[15,3,0],"block":"minecraft:bricks"},{"op":"line",